    "ov.meta.title": "Overseas - Lin Xin",
    "ov.meta.desc": "Top-down pixel survival fishing in C++ on DigiPen's Alpha Engine. I designed and built the fishing loop, the rarity-driven QTE, health and supply, shipwrecks, and shop upgrades.",
    "ov.video.fallback": "Your browser does not support the video tag.",
    "ov.lead": "Top-down pixel survival fishing. Resource loop, quota, and a QTE on a small boat.",
